  "body": "Tucked in a peaceful corner setting, this newly modernised brick-and-tile residence combines refined elegance with ultimate privacy. Fully certified with a complete CCC, it presents an unmissable turn-key opportunity for discerning buyers!\r\n•  Quality Renovation + CCC\r\n\r\nFeatures a sleek modern kitchen and bathroom, refreshed interiors, and an expansive brand-new deck tailored for sun-drenched entertaining.\r\n•  Solid & Low-Maintenance\r\n\r\nTimeless brick-and-tile construction provides durability, giving you total peace of mind and effortless living.\r\n•  Private Garden Retreat\r\n\r\nEnjoy the premier end-unit position paired with a spacious established garden — your own peaceful outdoor oasis.\r\n•  New Driveway + Carport\r\n\r\nComplements a brand-new concrete driveway and generous carport for seamless off-street parking.\r\n•  3 Bedrooms | 1 Bathroom\r\n\r\nLight-filled, spacious, and comfortably proportioned for families, downsizers, or savvy investors.\r\n•  Unbeatable Milford Location\r\n\r\nStroll to Milford Village, Mall, beach, marina, cafés, and local eateries. Zoned for top schools: Westlake Boys' & Girls' Highs, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, and Milford Primary. Quick access to Smales Farm and motorways.\r\n•  Motivated Vendors – Must Sell!\r\n\r\nA fully renovated home in a prime coastal pocket. Move-in ready — act fast!",
